ble for review\nStudent evidence note:\nObserved between the lungs.\n\nReview prompts (not recorded evidence):\n- Which observable feature or relationship supports each identification?\n- What would you check next where evidence is missing or confidence is low?","id":"diss-observation-summary","readonly":"","rows":"9","aria-describedby":"diss-observation-export-help"},"Observation review — Frog (Rana)\nScope: All inspected · 1 of 1 inspected structures\nStudent notes from the virtual dissection. Confidence is self-reported; this summary does not verify identification accuracy or mastery.\nOnly inspected structures in this specimen are included. Missing notes and confidence remain explicitly unrecorded.\n\n1. Heart (3-chamber)\nLayer: Organs\nConfidence: Somewhat sure (2 of 3)\nDocumentation: Note and confidence recorded\nLayer access: Available for review\nStudent evidence note:\nObserved between the lungs.\n\nReview prompts (not recorded evidence):\n- Which observable feature or relationship supports each identification?\n- What would you check next where evidence is missing or confidence is low?"],["DIV",{"class":"diss-observation-export__actions"},["BUTTON",{"type":"button"},"Copy summary"],["BUTTON",{"type":"button"},"Download text"],["BUTTON",{"type":"button"},"Select summary"]],["P",{},"This preview is read-only. Use Review note on a structure to revise the original evidence."]],["UL",{"id":"diss-observation-review-list","class":"diss-observation-review__list"},["LI",{"class":"diss-observation-review__item","data-observation-entry":"heart"},["H4",{},"Heart (3-chamber)"],["P",{},"Organs layer · Confidence 2 of 3"],["P",{},"Note and confidence recorded"],["DETAILS",{},["SUMMARY",{},"Read saved note"],["P",{"class":"diss-observation-review__note"},"Observed between the lungs."]],["BUTTON",{"type":"button"},"Review note: Heart (3-chamber)"]]]]],[[23,11]],[[105,1086]],[[21,49]],[[105,1156]],[[105,1182]],[[105,1234]],[[23,23]],[[105,1378]]]]]],[[109,22]],[[109,23]],